WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.800
Narrator: Now watch Noura.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:06.040
Narrator: She stands to the side, out of reach, hands open.

3
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:07.360
Narrator: She listens first.

4
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:11.360
Noura: I understand - your cousin is inside and you don't want to miss kick-off.

5
00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.800
Noura: Can you call him? Is the ticket on his phone?

6
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:21.380
Noura: Let's step out of the queue to this side. You call your cousin, and I'll ask my supervisor what we can do.

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.360
Narrator: Notice she never says no entry - or calm down.

